<title>INDIA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA TAKE 77 RUN LEAD AT CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA TAKE 77 RUN LEAD AT CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>NAGPUR, India 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa were  33 runs without loss in their second innings at close of play, an overall lead of 77, on the second day of their three-day game against an Indian A selection on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 384-5 declared and 33-0, India 340.</p>
